              <div>
                <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Revenue for use of certain transmission facilities and the respondent's 345 kV transmission line that connects at the Illinois-Indiana state line with ComEd's system, and at the point in Porter County, Indiana, with Indiana Michigan Power Company's system.</span>
