            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:18.900%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="15" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The approximately 20 miles of transmission facilities owned by the respondent are used as a "pass-through" for the purpose of wheeling electricity to and from the electricity grid of its parent, ComEd. ComEd's transmission facilities and the respondent's transmission facilities are managed and operated as one integrated system under one transmission-pricing tariff. PJM allocates revenues and expenses to ComEd associated with the use of ComEd's and the respondent's transmission facilities.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
